multiflexi.eu for Debian
=======================

JSON schemas
------------

The hub Apache configuration publishes the JSON Schema files installed by
php-vitexsoftware-multiflexi-core:

* https://<host>/schema/application.json
* https://<host>/schema/credential-type.json
* https://<host>/schema/credential-prototype.json
* https://<host>/schema/report.json

On the public site those URLs are https://multiflexi.eu/schema/*.json.
Enable mod_headers if you want CORS headers on schema responses
(``a2enmod headers``).

